# Build artifacts are deliberately NOT ignored. main carries the current dev build
# so the documented raw-URL download always serves the newest code, and each release
# carries the stable build as a downloadable asset. Ignoring them here would have no
# effect anyway - they are tracked, and .gitignore does not apply to tracked files,
# which is how dev builds used to leak into main one broad `git add` at a time.

# Development tools
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
.vscode/

# Internal test harness (not published)
tests/

# Logs & temp files
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*~
temp/
tmp/

# Certificates & credentials
*.pfx
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.kirbi
*.ccache

# OS files
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini